---
import AssetImage from '../AssetImage.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../SectionHeading.astro';
---
<section class="apiary">
    <AssetImage class="apiary__image" sizes="(max-width: 899px) 1440px, 100vw" src="/assets/apiary.jpg" loading="lazy"
                alt="Ule na kwitnącej łące z górami i lasem w tle"/>
    <div class="container apiary__content">
        <SectionHeading eyebrow="Wędrowna pasieka" light>Z naturą<br/>w najlepszych miejscach</SectionHeading>
        <p>Nasza pasieka wędruje w poszukiwaniu różnorodnych, bogatych pożytków. Rytm kwitnienia wyznacza kolejne
            przystanki, a każde miejsce nadaje miodom wyjątkowy charakter i smak.</p>
    </div>
</section>
<style>
    .apiary {
        position: relative;
        isolation: isolate;
        display: grid;
        align-items: center;
        height: var(--media-apiary);
        padding-block: 48px;
        background: var(--color-dark);
        color: var(--color-white);
    }

    .apiary__image {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: -2;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: 60% center;
    }

    .apiary::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        z-index: -1;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #172016d9, #17201699 32%, #1720160d 75%);
    }

    .apiary__content :global(h2) {
        max-width: 15ch;
        font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 3.6vw, 3.8rem);
    }

    .apiary__content > p {
        max-width: 39ch;
        margin-top: var(--space-3);
        font-size: .9375rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 899px) {
        .apiary {
            align-items: end;
            padding-block: var(--space-section-sm);
        }

        .apiary::before {
            background: linear-gradient(0deg, #172016ed, #172016a6 45%, #17201608 100%);
        }

        .apiary__image {
            object-position: 62% center;
        }

        .apiary__content > p {
            max-width: 46ch;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 639px) {
        .apiary__image {
            object-position: 64% center;
        }
    }
</style>
